4.
Eligibility Criteria for recognition of veterinary colleges.
- The following organisations shall be eligible to apply in Form-I for recognition of a veterinary college or veterinary
qualification, namely: -
(i)
a State Government or Union territory;
(ii)
a University;
(iii)
an autonomous body promoted by the Central and State Government by or under a statute for the purpose of veterinary
education;
(iv)
a society registered under the Societies Registration Act, 1860 (21 of 1860) or corresponding Acts in States, if any;
(v)
